# SPA fallback for static hosts that read this file (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages).
#
# Render is not one of them. It takes rewrites from rules configured in its own
# dashboard, or from a `routes:` block in an applied blueprint, and ignores this
# file completely — which is why a direct load of /dashboard came back as the
# host's plain-text "Not Found" while this sat in web/dist looking like a fix.
# What works there is the per-route index.html emitted by web/vite.config.ts.
#
# 200 rather than a redirect: the URL the user typed has to stay in the address
# bar for React Router to read it.
/*  /index.html  200
